  <metadata>
    <name>Cieceres dabas taka Saldū (turp un atpakaļ)</name>
    <desc>Full established Ciecere riverside trail in Saldus, out and back. Source published by Mapeirons and linked by Kurzeme Planning Region, retrieved 2026-09-05. Reverse the first of two source sections and join to the second at their shared starting location (1.65 m GPS offset), then retrace the entire trail. Includes urban riverside paths and steps.</desc>
    <link href="https://kurzemesregions.lv/projekti/turisms/unigreen/dabas-takas/cieceres-dabas-taka-saldu/" />
    <link href="https://mapeirons.eu/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Ciecere-nature-trail-in-Saldus.gpx" />
  </metadata>
